This release upgrades the existing patch under app.hiro.tiktoklink.patches.
It replaces the five explicitly inventoried JVM loader entries of Link Direct 1.0.1
and the corresponding owned DEX loader definitions. All unrelated loader definitions,
JVM entries, runtime extensions, resources and prior notices are preserved.
The new notice is added at META-INF/hiro-tiktok-link-direct102/.
The new extension extensions/hiro_tiktok_link_direct.mpe contains only the
app.hiro.tiktoklink.runtime namespace. It does not replace the inherited OneBack
runtime. Its corresponding source is included under src/runtime/.

Corresponding new source, build tooling, actual-APK validation evidence and publication
procedures are included in the sources_and_QA archive and at:
https://github.com/hiro191u3n2/hiro-morphe-patches/tree/tiktok-link-v1.0.2/releases/tiktok-link-direct102

